  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://tw.rpi.edu/ontology-engineering/oe2026/tracking-cjf/CQSample/Turn_12">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://tw.rpi.edu/ontology-engineering/oe2026/tracking-cjf/Utterance"/>
    <cjf:hasConversationText>I’m not sure that cost comparison includes everything. Doesn’t Platform B require separate licenses for the deployment and identity extensions?</cjf:hasConversationText>
