    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://tw.rpi.edu/ontology-engineering/oe2026/tracking-cjf/TextSpan"/>
    <cjf:hasConversationText>I’d still prefer Platform B at this point. We should consider adopting it instead, especially given the budget gap.</cjf:hasConversationText>
